  {
    "name": "azul_code_phone_pixel8_drawer_sheet_keys_host",
    "description": "AzCode in a 411 x 914 window (pixel8), as a phone shows it: the editor is the screen, the explorer a drawer over a scrim, the panel a sheet from the bottom, a key row over the keyboard's place, one status bar line. Pictures, in order: 1 first look, 2 the drawer (explorer), 3 the file in the editor, 4 the key row, 5 the panel's sheet, 6 drawn up, 7 pushed down, 8 source control, 9 run, 10 light (the phone itself has a picture of the braces typed by the key row after the 4th).",
